  "term": "awareness training",
  "definition": "Awareness training refers here to the Awareness Training Program, a group-based mental training approach that includes compassion and wisdom meditation as core practices. In the source, it is used to help people regulate negative emotions by influencing attention, thinking, and behavioral responses.",
